== Notes ==

* This spell requires a successful [[touch attack]]. Spell resistance is only checked if the touch attack succeeds.<!-- too obviously the way it should work? -->
* The temporary hit points last for one [[hour]] per two caster levels. Any pre-existing temporary hit points (from any source) are removed before the new ones are applied.
* This spell will do nothing if cast on a non-creature, a creature protected by ''[[negative energy protection]]'', an [[undead]] creature, a [[construct]], or a friendly creature (accounting for the [[PvP setting]]). In these cases, the target is not even informed that a hostile spell was attempted against it.
* The temporary hit points are resolved independent of the application of the damage. Reducing or increasing the damage (presumably by [[damage resistance]], [[immunity]], or vulnerability) does not similarly affect the temporary hit points.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''negative energy protection'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

